---- MODULE CardLifecycle ----
\* Daily CDR syncs moving cards through lifecycle.listing (Listed, Missing,
\* Delisted) while brand product lists time out, CDR has an outage, or most of a
\* brand's cards vanish at once and wait for a maintainer in a listing hold.
\* The lifecycle, brand fetch and hold tables come from the real code through
\* CardLifecycleCode (generated by tools/verify/lifecycle-table.ts). The run
\* itself follows syncCdr in src/sync/Sync.ts.
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, CardLifecycleCode

CONSTANTS MaxDay

\* Model scope: brand A has one card that is closed to new applicants; brand B
\* has three cards, one with `locked = ["lifecycle"]`; ten more cards from
\* other brands only matter to the outage guard.
Cards == {"a1", "b1", "b2", "b3"}
BrandOf == [c \in Cards |-> IF c = "a1" THEN "A" ELSE "B"]
Locked == {"b3"}
StartSales == [c \in Cards |-> IF c = "a1" THEN "Closed" ELSE "Selling"]
Other == 10

Brands == {BrandOf[c] : c \in Cards}
CardsOf(b) == {c \in Cards : BrandOf[c] = b}
Open == {"AwaitingApproval", "AwaitingConfirmation", "Approved", "Rejected"}

VARIABLES
  day,          \* today's UTC date, as a day number
  inCdr,        \* whether the issuer's CDR product list includes the card
  listing,      \* lifecycle.listing._tag stored on the card
  ldate,        \* Missing.since or Delisted.on, as a day number (0 when Listed)
  sales,        \* lifecycle.sales._tag stored on the card
  hold,         \* state of the card's lifecycle.listing hold in sync-holds.toml
  hsince,       \* that hold's `since`
  missedOn,     \* history: first day of the card's current run of misses
  missedLater,  \* history: a successful listing missed it again on a later day
  badMiss,      \* history: left Listed in a run its brand failed, or while locked
  badVanish,    \* history: left Listed with most of its brand, unapproved
  notRelisted   \* history: a successful run listed it and it stayed unlisted

vars == <<day, inCdr, listing, ldate, sales, hold, hsince, missedOn, missedLater,
          badMiss, badVanish, notRelisted>>

LRow(tag, earlier, s, event) ==
  CHOOSE r \in ListingRows : r[1] = tag /\ r[2] = earlier /\ r[3] = s /\ r[4] = event

\* Whether a brand ends the run with a listError: the retried result when the
\* first try was Retrying (Sync.ts fetched/retried), else the first result.
FailedAfter(r) == IF r[3] = "Retrying" THEN r[2] # "ok" ELSE r[1] # "ok"
FailOptions == {FailedAfter(r) : r \in FetchRows}

HRow(prior, earlier, kind) ==
  CHOOSE r \in ResolveRows : r[1] = prior /\ r[2] = earlier /\ r[3] = kind

Decide(prior, decision) ==
  (CHOOSE r \in DecideRows : r[1] = prior /\ r[2] = decision)[3]

Init ==
  /\ day = 1
  /\ inCdr = [c \in Cards |-> TRUE]
  /\ listing = [c \in Cards |-> "Listed"]
  /\ ldate = [c \in Cards |-> 0]
  /\ sales = StartSales
  /\ hold = [c \in Cards |-> "none"]
  /\ hsince = [c \in Cards |-> 0]
  /\ missedOn = [c \in Cards |-> 0]
  /\ missedLater = [c \in Cards |-> FALSE]
  /\ badMiss = FALSE /\ badVanish = FALSE /\ notRelisted = FALSE

NewDay ==
  /\ day < MaxDay
  /\ day' = day + 1
  /\ UNCHANGED <<inCdr, listing, ldate, sales, hold, hsince, missedOn, missedLater,
                 badMiss, badVanish, notRelisted>>

\* The issuer adds a card back to, or drops it from, its CDR product list.
CdrListChanges ==
  /\ \E c \in Cards : inCdr' = [inCdr EXCEPT ![c] = ~inCdr[c]]
  /\ UNCHANGED <<day, listing, ldate, sales, hold, hsince, missedOn, missedLater,
                 badMiss, badVanish, notRelisted>>

\* `held approve|reject <id>` on a card's listing hold.
MaintainerDecides ==
  /\ \E c \in Cards, d \in {"approve", "reject"} :
       /\ hold[c] \in Open
       /\ Decide(hold[c], d) # "refused"
       /\ hold' = [hold EXCEPT ![c] = Decide(hold[c], d)]
  /\ UNCHANGED <<day, inCdr, listing, ldate, sales, hsince, missedOn, missedLater,
                 badMiss, badVanish, notRelisted>>

\* One syncCdr run. failed says which brands still have a listError after the
\* single retry (fetchBrand, stepFetch, settleFetch); otherUp says whether the
\* rest of the Register answered (the MIN_SEEN_SHARE outage guard).
SyncRuns ==
  \E failed \in [Brands -> FailOptions], otherUp \in BOOLEAN :
    LET listedNow[c \in Cards] == ~failed[BrandOf[c]] /\ inCdr[c]
        seen == Cardinality({c \in Cards : listedNow[c]}) + (IF otherUp THEN Other ELSE 0)
        active == Cardinality({c \in Cards : listing[c] # "Delisted"}) + Other
        keys[b \in Brands] ==
          IF failed[b] THEN {}
          ELSE {c \in CardsOf(b) : listing[c] # "Delisted" /\ ~inCdr[c] /\ c \notin Locked}
        activeIn(b) == Cardinality({c \in CardsOf(b) : listing[c] # "Delisted"})
        vanished(b) ==
          Cardinality(keys[b]) * 100 > activeIn(b) * MaxDiscontinuedPct /\ Cardinality(keys[b]) > 1
        missed(c) == c \in keys[BrandOf[c]]
        cand(c) == IF vanished(BrandOf[c]) /\ listing[c] = "Listed" THEN "approve" ELSE "none"
        touched(c) == (listedNow[c] /\ hold[c] # "none") \/ (missed(c) /\ (cand(c) # "none" \/ hold[c] # "none"))
        hr(c) == HRow(hold[c], hsince[c] < day, IF listedNow[c] THEN "none" ELSE cand(c))
        event(c) == IF listedNow[c] THEN "Seen" ELSE "NotSeen"
        lr(c) == LRow(listing[c], ldate[c] < day, sales[c], event(c))
        moves(c) == listedNow[c] \/ (missed(c) /\ ~(touched(c) /\ hr(c)[4] = "revert"))
        nextListing(c) == IF moves(c) THEN lr(c)[5] ELSE listing[c]
        nextDate(c) ==
          IF ~moves(c) THEN ldate[c]
          ELSE IF lr(c)[6] = "today" THEN day ELSE IF lr(c)[6] = "earlier" THEN ldate[c] ELSE 0
        nextSales(c) == IF moves(c) THEN lr(c)[7] ELSE sales[c]
        nextHold(c) == IF touched(c) THEN (IF hr(c)[5] = "gone" THEN "none" ELSE hr(c)[5]) ELSE hold[c]
        nextHsince(c) ==
          IF ~touched(c) THEN hsince[c]
          ELSE IF hr(c)[6] = "today" THEN day ELSE IF hr(c)[6] = "kept" THEN hsince[c] ELSE 0
        leaves(c) == listing[c] = "Listed" /\ nextListing(c) # "Listed"
    IN IF active > 0 /\ seen * 100 < active * MinSeenPct
         THEN UNCHANGED vars
         ELSE
           /\ listing' = [c \in Cards |-> nextListing(c)]
           /\ ldate' = [c \in Cards |-> nextDate(c)]
           /\ sales' = [c \in Cards |-> nextSales(c)]
           /\ hold' = [c \in Cards |-> nextHold(c)]
           /\ hsince' = [c \in Cards |-> nextHsince(c)]
           /\ missedOn' = [c \in Cards |->
                IF listedNow[c] THEN 0 ELSE IF missed(c) /\ missedOn[c] = 0 THEN day ELSE missedOn[c]]
           /\ missedLater' = [c \in Cards |->
                IF listedNow[c] THEN FALSE
                ELSE missedLater[c] \/ (missed(c) /\ missedOn[c] # 0 /\ day > missedOn[c])]
           /\ badMiss' = (badMiss \/ \E c \in Cards : leaves(c) /\ (failed[BrandOf[c]] \/ c \in Locked))
           /\ badVanish' = (badVanish \/ \E c \in Cards : leaves(c) /\ vanished(BrandOf[c]) /\ hold[c] # "Approved")
           /\ notRelisted' = (notRelisted \/ \E c \in Cards : listedNow[c] /\ nextListing(c) # "Listed")
           /\ UNCHANGED <<day, inCdr>>

Next ==
  \/ NewDay
  \/ CdrListChanges
  \/ MaintainerDecides
  \/ SyncRuns

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

\* Rules a maintainer agrees to.
DelistedOnlyAfterTwoDays == \A c \in Cards : listing[c] = "Delisted" => missedLater[c]
DelistedDateIsAMissDay == \A c \in Cards : listing[c] = "Delisted" => ldate[c] >= missedOn[c]
NeverMissingOnFailedFetchOrLock == ~badMiss
MassVanishWaitsForApproval == ~badVanish
SeenCardIsListed == ~notRelisted
SalesUntouchedBySync == sales = StartSales
====
